{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1521492-chronicles-of-dankness-is-back","id":1521492,"title":"Chronicles of Dankness is Back!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-27T21:34:31-07:00","id":1521492,"title":"Chronicles of Dankness is Back!","content":"<img width=\"281\" height=\"500\" data-align=\"left\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Qvn1qtv/chron-Dank-Skull.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.ibb.co/Qvn1qtv/chron-Dank-Skull.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.ibb.co/Qvn1qtv/chron-Dank-Skull.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_left js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChmkZeJUBisyaGUb5nk_KiA\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChm...isyaGUb5nk_KiA</a><br /> <br /> The Dank Chronicles are back! New and improved! Some other descriptor that's catchy and attention-grabbing!<br /> <br /> Okay, that's enough of that. For those who don't know: I made some parody videos on Chronicles of Darkness and its various gamelines back in 2016. With crappy audio recording from my headset mic (yes, I literally used that for those vids) and ripping videos from various places (mostly from Vine), I made a bunch of skits and compiled them in a few videos with a long, drawn-out intro to artificially create some length. The result was Chronicles of Dankness.<br /> <br /> It went on indefinite hiatus due to me being a lazy bum. As a means of getting off said bum and actually doing something with my life, I've decided to remake this series with some significant changes: first, I got myself a better mic to record along with some sound-proofing (which constitutes me wrapping some egg-crate foam over my head which I affectionately call my &quot;Sound Cowl&quot;) to get <i>much</i> better audio quality. Second, rather than group them up in compilations with a boring intro, I've made each skit its own video with a short &amp; sweet outro using the picture you see here (no, I'm not planning on monetizing these videos; please don't sue me Onyx Path/White Wolf/Paradox).<br /> <br /> I'll probably expand this onto Tiktok and Rumble as well. Maybe some other sites, too. I'm hoping that if I can keep this series up for a significant while, I'll work up enough confidence in myself to create longer videos for other ideas I had, such as how you can play Stranger Things as a ChronDark game. Even if that doesn't pan out, at least it'll keep me from using my free time to constantly doom-scroll.<br /> <br /> Hopes you guys enjoy!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T05:24:59-07:00","id":1521584,"title":"","content":"More Chronicles content is always a good thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}